    "Ground truth from the Scala reference stack (sigma-state 6.0.2 + ergo-core 6.0.2),",
    "generated by scripts/jvm_evaluated_value_oracle/EvaluatedValueOracle.scala (sections",
    "'transaction id canonicalizes the ContextExtension', 'GroupElement normalization',",
    "'block-level: transactionsRoot').",
    "",
    "transactions: a 1-in/1-out tx whose sole input carries `extension_wire_hex` VERBATIM.",
    "`ErgoLikeTransaction.id` = Blake2b256(bytesToSign) and bytesToSign rebuilds every input",
    "from the PARSED ContextExtension (ErgoLikeTransaction.scala:190-197 -> Input.serializer ->",
    "ProverResult.serializer -> ContextExtension.serializer.serialize), so the id commits to the",
    "CANONICAL encoding: TrueLeaf 7f / FalseLeaf 80 / non-canonical Boolean 0105 re-serialize as",
    "0101 / 0100 (ValueSerializer routes every Constant through ConstantSerializer), while the",
    "node forms 0x82 / 0x83 / 0x85 / 0x86 are preserved byte-for-byte. `canonical_tx_hex` is",
    "ErgoTransactionSerializer.toBytes(parse(wire)).",
    "",
    "boxes: ErgoBoxCandidate `c0843d10010101d17300000001 07 <ge>` (value 1000000, sigmaProp(true),",
    "R4 = GroupElement constant) minted by txid 07*32 at output index 3. GroupElementSerializer.parse",
    "(GroupElementSerializer.scala:35-42) maps ANY 33 bytes with a 0x00 lead to the infinity point and",
    "serialize (:20-33) writes infinity as 33 zeroes; ErgoBox.id is Blake2b256 of the RE-SERIALIZED",
    "box bytes (ErgoBox.scala:87-92), so `07 00 aa*32` and `07 00*33` share one id.",
    "",
    "transactions_root: BlockTransactions(hdr, version 3, Seq(tx)).digest over the tx carrying",
    "extension 01017f equals the one carrying 01010101 (IDENTICAL), because the digest is built",
    "over the canonical ids."
